counterarguments to you. So good.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:20.460
It can also read all the materials&nbsp;
about important historical figures,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:26.460
and that means that we can even make a&nbsp;
history class come alive by talking to George&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:34.440
Washington. Or even to a god, Zeus himself.&nbsp;
Ah mortal! I love it. This is incredible.

